  "id": "night-floor-switch",
  "description": "Floor switches alone at night: on the household's lot, paused, floors 1, 2 and 3 shown in turn eight times (3 s each), nothing edited, so every room solve and light change in that minute comes from the switches. Developer switch room_solve_causes on (its minute lines name who sent each room); run with -Grab for the light changes. Nothing is saved. Developer mode on, the background frame limit lifted.",
